        "en": "0.2 s and 0.21 s"
      },
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d",
      "text": {
        "en": "5.0 s in both cases"
      },
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctOptionId": "a",
  "explanation": {
    "en": "Time = distance ÷ speed. At 344 m/s: 1720 ÷ 344 = 5.0 s. At 331 m/s: 1720 ÷ 331 = about 5.2 s. In colder air, sound is slower, so it takes about 0.2 s longer."
  },
  "hints": [
    {
      "en": "Use time = distance ÷ speed."
    },
    {
      "en": "Slower sound takes longer to cover the same distance."
    }
